3. COMMERCIAL & ENTERPRISE RESTRICTIONS (Tiers 2, 3, & Sovereign)
================================================================================

Commercial production use, enterprise deployment, and managed service hosting require a 
valid KHEPRA License Key (`KHEPRA_LICENSE_KEY` or `KHEPRA_LICENSE_PATH`).

  a) COMMERCIAL PRODUCTION GATING:
     Execution of premium, enterprise, and sovereign capabilities—including but not limited to:
     - Subnet and Enterprise CIDR AI Discovery (`scan_shadow_ai`)
     - Post-Quantum Attestation & Signed Evidence DAG Chains (`attest_ai_policy`, `aeo_record`)
     - Agent Passports (`passport_issue`, `passport_verify`)
     - CMMC AU/SC and POAM export engines (`khepra_export_poam`, `khepra_export_attestation`)
     - Autonomous WAF interposition, Sekhem healing, and active interdiction (`interdict`)
     - FIPS 140-3 BoringCrypto PQC compilation (`GOEXPERIMENT=boringcrypto`)
     - Multi-tenant fleet governance and SCIF air-gap licensing
     requires an active commercial subscription (Pro, Sovereign, or Pharaoh tier) 
     issued directly by SOUHIMBOU DOH KONE LLC or its authorized distributors.

  b) MANAGED SERVICE & SAAS RESTRICTION:
     You MAY NOT offer, host, or rebrand the PQC-Khepra-MCP Server or KHEPRA Trust OS 
     as a managed cloud service, Hosted MCP Gateway, or SaaS product to third parties for 
     commercial gain without an explicit written Commercial Service Provider Agreement 
     from SOUHIMBOU DOH KONE LLC.

